---
/**
 * Full-bleed operational scene.
 * Source: website/public/home/taico-tkmc-800-ev-parking-hero.webp
 * Selected because it shows a TAICO mobile charger connected to an EV
 * in a parking environment, at sufficient resolution for a wide crop.
 */
---

<section class="scene-banner" aria-labelledby="scene-banner-heading">
  <img
    src="/home/taico-tkmc-800-ev-parking-hero.webp"
    alt="TAICO mobile energy storage charging system connected to an electric vehicle in a parking lot"
    width="1280"
    height="720"
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
  />
  <div class="scene-banner-copy">
    <p class="label-tech">Field deployment</p>
    <h2 id="scene-banner-heading">Mobile energy, deployed where operations need it.</h2>
    <p>Bring charging capacity to the vehicle when a fixed bay is not the operating format.</p>
    <a class="btn-hero-ghost !px-4 !py-2 text-xs" href="/contact/">Talk to a specialist</a>
  </div>
</section>
